certhaven (0.11.0-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * A CA's private key can be taken offline: download it as an encrypted
    PKCS#12 file, then remove it from certhaven. Importing the file brings
    it back and re-signs the CA's CRL.
  * Each CA can have its own CRL validity.
  * Offline CAs are flagged 30 days before their CRL expires.

 -- tvjay <11197859+tvjay@users.noreply.github.com>  Wed, 11 Nov 2026 01:28:35 -0500

